OL,3,GNEWSATwo deals discussed before
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has said two possible options
OL,8,Fwere on the table during talks to
OL,9,Fresolve the Drumcree parade dispute.
OL,11,FSir Chris banned the contentious Orange
OL,12,FOrder parade at Drumcree on Friday
OL,13,Fafter an agreement couldn't be reached
OL,14,Fbetween the Portadown District Lodge
OL,15,Fand the Garvaghy Road residents.
OL,17,FThe dispute led to a stand-off between
OL,18,FOrangemen and nationalist residents of
OL,19,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown lasting
OL,20,Falmost two weeks.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
