OL,3,GNEWSATwo deals discussed before
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris said his decision came after
OL,7,Fadvice from the the PSNI chief
OL,8,Fconstable that allowing the procession
OL,9,Fto go ahead could lead to serious
OL,10,Finjury, disorder and wider unrest
OL,11,Facross Northern Ireland.
